  "description": "Click here and download the Rawbotnix font · Window, Mac, Linux · Last updated 2026 · Commercial licence included ✓",
  "fullDescription": "RAWBOTNIX is a bold, quirky display font inspired by messy robotic doodles and imperfect sketch aesthetics. Designed to feel intentionally rough, clumsy, and slightly chaotic, this font embraces a raw, hand-drawn character that stands out in a world of clean perfection.\n\nWith its scribbly outlines and uneven strokes, RAWBOTNIX delivers a playful robotic vibe—perfect for designs that need personality, humor, and a touch of “beautiful imperfection.”\n\n✨ Key Features\nUppercase & Lowercase\nNumbers & Punctuation\nMultilingual Support\nTotal 209 Glyphs\nHand-drawn sketch style\nUnique robotic / doodle aesthetic\n🎨 Style & Personality\n\nRAWBOTNIX combines:\n\n🤖 Robotic forms\n✏️ Rough sketch lines\n😵 Imperfect & clumsy charm\n🎮 Retro pixel / MS Paint vibe\n\nThe result? A font that feels alive, weird, and expressive.\n\n💡 Perfect For\nStreet / urban design\nKids & playful branding\nPosters & album covers\nComic / cartoon visuals\nExperimental typography\nSocial media graphics\nDIY / handmade-style projects\n🧠 Design Concept\n\nRAWBOTNIX is built around the idea that imperfection creates character.\nInstead of clean geometry, it celebrates:\n\nuneven strokes\nawkward proportions\n“wrong but right” shapes\n\nIt feels like a robot tried to draw letters… and almost succeeded.",
